            "detailed_description": "A mysterious tower has risen! It emits plumes of noxious green smoke from<br>its summit making people sick. Strange creatures infest the tower but if<br>nobody tries to ascend it we will all be doomed!<br><br>Are you that hero?.....<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomised for replay. Every run is different!<br></li><li>Evolve your abilities and skill to progress ever further up the tower!.<br></li><li>4 Themed zones to ascend!<br></li><li>Unique hazards and monsters to each zone!<br></li><li>4 Epic End Zone Boss Fights!<br></li><li>Loads of Gun Types including, Laser, T Gun, Bubble Gun and Shotgun!<br></li><li>25 Suits to unlock each with unique abilities that affect play.<br></li><li>Upgrade yourself at the end of each level with 20 upgrade abilities!</li></ul>",
